---
args: {"trial": "AdministrativeTrial", "metrics": "AdministrativeMetric[]", "episodes": "AdministrativeEpisode[]", "associations": "JourneyAssociation[]"}
returns: "AdministrativeOutcome"
---
Bind frameFindings = compareObservationFrame(trial, metrics). Separate comparable metrics from those with changed population, channel availability or denominator. Require actual implementation receipts before attributing a change to the trial. Interpret exact metric ratios alongside independent follow-up episodes, severe minority experiences and downstream workload. Missing burden measurements or incompatible frames require inconclusive/revise, not adoption. Preserve evidence supporting abandonment as clearly as evidence supporting benefit.
